# First User vs Returning User Intelligence

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-first-vs-returning-user.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-first-vs-returning-user.md)

## Principle

New Care Reality → **begin** the story (capture + organize).  
Existing Care Reality → **continue** the story (compare + change).

Never fake continuity. Never restart when memory exists. Not a per-message chatbot.

## Must

- Classify from held observation/CRS depth — not session UI alone  
- New: first memory anchor; known vs unclear; no “already held” theater  
- Returning: already known / new / changed / still unclear  
- High-value asks only; no onboarding forms before value  

## Never

Diagnose · false certainty · empty dashboards · long questionnaires · hardcoded scenario templates
